        <mxCell id="df_note" value="Key thesis point: the artifact exposes explicit intermediate objects.&#xa;This makes the process inspectable and easier to justify than a black-box LLM pipeline." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1c">
